# Cursor & Kiro Agent Rules for Capability Hub AI

- Always inspect `AGENTS.md` and `.kiro/instructions.md` before making architectural modifications.
- Keep all Gemini API calls server-side in `server.ts` or `server-db.ts` using `@google/genai` SDK and model `gemini-3.6-flash`.
- Always verify changes with `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) and `npm run build`.
- Maintain the dark enterprise theme palette (#141E30 canvas, #0F1724 cards, #4F8EF7 / #10B981 accents).
- Do not remove hardware permission declarations (`camera`, `microphone`) from `metadata.json`.
